title Sign in to Scotty from the Mac app
sub Drawn before modeling, from the sign-in screen's intent

== graph Sign in to Scotty
view: states
tone wait: Waiting for you
tone ask: Waiting for the browser
tone done: Using Scotty
tone bad: Something went wrong
[*] -> signin
signin: Sign in to Scotty {wait}
waiting: Finish signing in in your browser {ask}
list: Your sessions {done}
failed: Signing in didn't finish {bad}
lost: You sign in, and the app throws the new sign-in away
  fails: NoFreshTokenLost
bounced: Asked to sign in while signed in
  fails: NoBounceWithGoodToken
reset: The sign-in screen resets while the browser is open
  fails: SignInNotReset
signin -> waiting: press Sign in with Cloudflare
waiting -> list: browser login completes
waiting -> signin: press Cancel
waiting -> failed: login fails
failed -> waiting: press Try again
list -> signin: Access refuses the saved sign-in
signin -> list: press Sign in, a sign-in already saved
failed -> list: press Try again, a sign-in already saved
first: signin > waiting => list | first launch | You sign in in the browser and your sessions load.
cancel: signin > waiting => signin | changed your mind | You cancel and are back on the sign-in screen.
fail: signin > waiting => failed | login fails | The login fails and you can try again.
retry: signin > waiting > failed > waiting => list | try again | After a failure, Try again signs you in.
expired: signin > waiting > list => signin | session ended | Access ends your session and the app asks you to sign in again.
late: signin > waiting > signin => list | cancelled too late | The browser finished as you pressed Cancel; Sign in goes straight in.
